[{"title":"游平远台","author":"李廷美","text":"二十馀年泛海萍，古台名胜始重登。\n身如方外逃虚子，心似人间有发僧。\n雁带寒来红入叶，梅惊秋老绿侵藤。\n日斜酒尽山门晚，千树松涛泻佛灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27544,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乌石山","author":"李廷美","text":"乌石蜿蜒势若龙，中峰叠出玉芙蓉。\n四围绿绕城边水，几点青来江上峰。\n宋主蒙尘留断刻，唐儒骂贼有遗踪。\n酒阑未尽登临兴，僧在翠微敲暮钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27545,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"又和韵","author":"李廷美","text":"赏春联骑到南山，纳纳乾坤指顾间。\n古碣有文挥藓看，仙岩无路倚萝攀。\n钓龙台下千艘集，演武场中万马閒。\n自是圣朝多雨露，白头饶许挂冠还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27546,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙卯元夕感怀","author":"李廷美","text":"满城灯火杂笙歌，老病其如好景何。\n愁逐肠回偏作阵，泪从心落欲成河。\n风飘香去笼花坞，月射窗来照茧窝。\n自笑平生最潇洒，不堪今夜寂寥多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27547,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭李和之","author":"李廷美","text":"少小交游到白头，忽闻哀讣泪滂流。\n孟郊不副韩公望，李白空贻杜甫愁。\n经学一函传菽粟，诗歌千古戛琳璆。\n伤心何处尤堪痛，旅榇迢迢向首邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27548,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林世增之春闱","author":"李廷美","text":"郭隗台前信使还，便携书剑出闽山。\n济时功业尊周召，经世文章在孔颜。\n杏苑探花三月里，枫宸献玉寸阴间。\n京华若问侗庵老，万顷云头一鹤閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27549,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送许纯嘏之春闱","author":"李廷美","text":"英妙才华誉四驰，秋风鹗荐上京师。\n太冲久有三都赋，韩愈今无二鸟词。\n天下名山游览日，道傍幽迹和吟时。\n浮云富贵何须问，要使香名勒鼎彝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27550,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晓词","author":"李廷仪","text":"繁花落尽莺声老，汀洲绿遍王孙草。\n百尺游丝拂地轻，一炉沈水披香早。\n长门深闭金锁合，小殿清幽玉阶扫。\n遥见朱衣小队来，隔花低唱风光好。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27551,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜词","author":"李廷仪","text":"檐铁铿风春梦醒，紫绫缩脱冰肌冷。\n瀼瀼玉露下空阶，半窗月弄庭花影。\n含颦起视牛女星，春山黛簇秋波凝。\n阑干倚遍不成寐，凄凉何处軥辀声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27552,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉歌赠王时彦之京","author":"李廷仪","text":"功名乐少年，栖迟淹老丑。\n世事难重陈，且饮杯中酒。\n灯前快意漫高歌，时下朱颜岂常有。\n劝君痛饮君莫辞，秋风落尽章台柳。\n古来贤达多不偶，腰间宝剑作龙吼。\n不用閒嗔里闬儿，彼识吾曹是谁否。\n君已醉，我未醒，起看东方明未明。\n摩娑两眼别君去，酒徒谁复长安市。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27553,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉渔图","author":"李廷仪","text":"短蓑宿雨晞残湿，一竿深坐矶头石。\n捲纶归去踏莎堤，笠影斜翻半山日。\n红杏桥边有酒家，将鱼换酒不须赊。\n醉倒竹根呼不醒，梦魂随月入芦花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27554,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枯木竹石","author":"李廷仪","text":"渴龙饮海海水枯，棱撑怪石云模糊。\n娲皇不用补天漏，长留对此珊瑚株。\n珊瑚十丈插云表，气势高压扶桑晓。\n昼长清气寒欲凝，一天凉思秋冥冥。\n须臾凤鸟西飞去，九疑对面何青青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27555,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何处难忘酒","author":"李廷仪","text":"何处难忘酒，寒衾梦觉时。\n青铜欺短发，黄菊候归期。\n翘首怀千里，论心乏故知。\n此时无一盏，何以慰遐私。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27556,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登虎邱","author":"李廷仪","text":"山寺遥闻白虎蹲，望中烟树小江村。\n台游麋鹿歌声尽，土蚀雌雄剑气存。\n霸业已销无限恨，吴宫空吊未归魂。\n凭高向晚孤吟处，凉月疏钟隔水闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27557,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早朝","author":"李廷仪","text":"银钥春开虎豹关，万方拜舞玉珊珊。\n银河露湿金茎柱，宝炬光摇玉笋班。\n风落钧天门左角，云扶帝座殿中间。\n欲知盛世无为意，退食夔龙纳谏还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27558,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"招宝山","author":"李廷仪","text":"乱峰历历送秋烟，翠岛如螺海上连。\n重译南来逢盛世，逝波东注惜流年。\n昔传方士求仙去，今见将军奏凯旋。\n绝顶天风发长啸，大鹏西繫水如天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27559,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中病起","author":"李廷仪","text":"短栏孤艇倚中流，历历江山拭远眸。\n溪影翠摇堤畔柳，波光晴拥驿边楼。\n宦途故旧多青眼，尘世功名尽白头。\n篷底才怜宁寝夜，又飞清梦绕皇州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27560,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过净居寺","author":"李廷仪","text":"淅淅西风着敝裘，净居长日水云幽。\n百年底事空啼鸟，几处寒林自送秋。\n白虎绕关山北拱，青龙夹道水东流。\n肩舆南下重回首，身在蓬山最上头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27561,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨恒叔山堂听雨限韵","author":"李廷仪","text":"昨夜毕星吾已占，朝来雨气映须髯。\n不劳行蚁先移穴，且听鸣鸠故傍帘。\n满地星红风片委，半池鸭绿夜痕添。\n偶来一聚逢三益，无限馀波醉里沾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27562,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日锡宴次韵","author":"李廷仪","text":"隐隐钟声出景阳，传宣锡宴近清光。\n萸觞共祝无疆寿，金鼎频薰百和香。\n内史分糕夸令节，诸番入贡自遐方。\n鹿鸣天宝赓歌遍，击筑何须说汉王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27563,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈骏之雷州教","author":"李廷仪","text":"潞浒长歌泊小舠，旋收红叶煮霜螯。\n雷庠今喜君来重，海国休云路去劳。\n官舍绿屯椰叶暝，讲堂红映荔枝高。\n天边作宦怜吾老，愁入乡园首重搔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27564,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人还莆","author":"李廷仪","text":"帝里逢春柳可攀，黄尘千丈拂衣还。\n一官莫道是何物，万事不如归故山。\n黄菊喜迎高士醉，白鸥今傍主人閒。\n木兰陂上应相待，钓艇夷犹水一湾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27565,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝坻道中","author":"李廷仪","text":"疋马萧萧踏软沙，官亭驻马夕阳斜。\n帝城回首三百里，民瘼关心几万家。\n古巷夜深无吠犬，新垣月落有啼鸦。\n此行莫叹瞻依远，几度羹墙见舜华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27566,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"公出南康留别诸广文","author":"李廷仪","text":"悠悠征旆拥前驺，山馆清虚且暂休。\n公事已拚三日了，广文仍喜一樽留。\n井边梧叶新凋雨，天上星河淡泻秋。\n明发溪头叹分手，离离芳草满汀洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27567,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀聂三尹","author":"李廷仪","text":"堂堂岁月去骎骎，才见红芳又绿阴。\n春草天涯孤客恨，暮云江上故人心。\n蝇蜗名利年来淡，湖海交情老愈深。\n欲整焦桐歌古调，半帘疏雨漏声沈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27568,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午饭琉璃寺次韵","author":"李廷仪","text":"沙路逶迤东复南，午阴僧寺驻羸骖。\n黄韰淡饭随时饱，土俗民情到处谙。\n西峤迎眸青霭霭，晚风吹鬓影毵毵。\n驿亭一夜萧萧雨，宦况离怀两不堪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27569,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祀张曲江祠","author":"李廷仪","text":"芙蓉叠叠拥梅关，霜落枫林色正斑。\n马向云中驰鸟道，人从海上见仙山。\n平时信史歆贤相，今日雄祠拜古颜。\n千载英魂招不返，悲歌空踏乱云还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27570,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村居散步","author":"李廷仪","text":"杖藜徐步意逍遥，望里风烟事事饶。\n偶遇腴田思种术，閒经断涧欲营桥。\n农家傍竹门深掩，古庙依山字半销。\n何处晚风吹古调，太平村落醉归樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27571,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"李廷仪","text":"秋阴漠漠掩重门，宝鸭香消火尚温。\n南雁不传沙漠信，满庭衰草自黄昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27572,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭君引","author":"李廷仪","text":"晓承明诏别金銮，上马啼红玉颊寒。\n寄语高坛休拜将，空凭粉黛博粗安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27573,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"眠竹径","author":"李廷仪","text":"小径疏疏竹几竿，春风披拂长琅玕。\n日长试展湘纹卧，一枕苍云入梦寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27574,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画竹","author":"李廷仪","text":"琼花冻勒苍龙骨，法水低淋彩凤翎。\n愁绝英皇浑不语，九疑相对数峰青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27575,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春阴","author":"李廷仪","text":"十日春无一日晴，玉阶芳草傍愁生。\n筚门静掩飞红乱，听尽流莺自在声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27576,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"濯陇图","author":"李廷仪","text":"濯陇雨晴春水生，人人驱犊陇头耕。\n太平不在笙歌里，只听前村打稻声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27577,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中酒熟","author":"李廷仪","text":"松花酒熟菊花期，野老门开对石矶。\n便唤邻翁相对饮，一帘疏雨看霏霏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27578,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王典史","author":"李廷仪","text":"云边驿路天低树，篷底寒声雁报秋。\n记取西风送君处，离离蘅杜满芳洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27579,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青郊归牧","author":"李廷仪","text":"庶草敷荣翠满墟，夕阳归牧雨晴初。\n清时只唱升平曲，牛角何心挂汉书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27580,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄李天瑞","author":"李廷仪","text":"花阴寂寂漏沈沈，孤馆残灯别恨深。\n遥忆去年寒食后，满天风雨夜同衾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27581,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送春","author":"李廷仪","text":"留春无计奈春何，满地莺声绿树多。\n痴蝶纷纷少情思，尚饕馀馥抱残柯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27582,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨州逢乡人","author":"李廷仪","text":"乡人不识识乡音，欲问先看泪满襟。\n岂是不知儿女态，天涯孤客易伤心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27583,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日偕谢邦实邵仁溥游乌石山浮觞浴鸦池","author":"许天锡","text":"好春无胜游，烟景难再续。\n眷我同心人，游衍绍芳躅。\n南寻乌石奇，萝径穷委曲。\n攀跻初阳峰，悠然豁遐瞩。\n千山收雨云，四泽涨春渌。\n天地净空明，乌兔互出没。\n落花轻且閒，点点浮红玉。\n流莺纵娇音，细草展繁缛。\n连衽俯天光，洗觞泛醽醁。\n四事偶相宜，一醉万分足。\n昔人哀须臾，夜游秉长烛。\n此意谁则知，啸歌山水绿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27584,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"户曹郑汝美李梦阳见过","author":"许天锡","text":"冰雪消未尽，春阳犹作悭。\n沈绵坐迟日，旷废羞清班。\n琴樽屏所爱，安得有欢颜。\n英曹郑与李，幸此慰间关。\n道言淡而馥，芳襟偕秉简。\n回飙披庭树，暝色动远山。\n开情尽杯勺，向夕惜馀閒。\n出门月皎皎，上马不可攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27585,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"君马黄","author":"许天锡","text":"君马黄，我马骝。\n白玉为辔勒，黄金装辔头。\n腰间何所佩，珌琫双纯钩。\n所期在远道，憩息昆崙邱。\n美人恐迟暮，驾言指东路。\n忽忽生别离，踽踽何所遇。\n我马亦悲鸣，十行九回顾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27586,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"休沐示同志","author":"许天锡","text":"休沐盍同簪，朱弦间清竹。\n氛昏豁而开，霏屑动盈掬。\n乃知静者心，往往爱幽独。\n明月炯虚檐，中宵未能宿。\n吾生苟有怀，詹尹何用卜。\n往者已如斯，逝波讵可复。\n脩途考初终，旧轨存倾覆。\n惟应同心人，此意筹已熟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27587,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画梅","author":"许天锡","text":"洞江野客半枯槁，只有梅花与倾倒。\n蹇驴破帽过南村，不为梅花被谁恼。\n交情冷淡无人知，怪我凌寒起常早。\n江头腊月正月间，云里十枝九枝好。\n自从作客向天涯，万里风烟迹如扫。\n是谁写此断肠魂，坐对相思令人老。\n可怜两度度春光，不得香名入诗草。\n今朝试笔为君题，清泪如丝洒元昊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27588,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨晴邀林清夫饮","author":"许天锡","text":"十日苦雨一尺泥，野人不出甘盐齑。\n石上苔还太古色，阶前草长如春荑。\n念子长为江海客，穷年不得同羹藜。\n邂逅归来始一笑，门前高马碧玉蹄。\n要路权家尚宾客，驼峰犀筋杯玻瓈。\n前者京城惜君别，古槐高柳秋凄凄。\n与子幸无一水隔，相望何乃成乖暌。\n人情世事多反覆，贫交还似糟糠妻。\n晴明迟子过我饮，只有斗酒兼黄鸡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27589,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次乔选郎宇咏新竹韵","author":"许天锡","text":"秋山暮雨收银竹，白岩轩前月可掬。\n开轩见月弄清影，辄有新诗续淇澳。\n翠筠缥节想停云，金薤银枝知夺目。\n此君择地托寸根，雪拥霜培渐蕃育。\n去年崛起才二三，今岁旋添馀五六。\n不随凡卉竟滋蔓，似识衰荣相倚伏。\n忆我江头坐啸时，风雨潇潇拂茅屋。\n别来几度长儿孙，回首光阴一何速。\n春城满眼桃李颜，如对宋朝亲卫祝。\n渴心爱濯君子风，幸接高林不须卜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27590,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画用杨京兆亘韵","author":"许天锡","text":"沧江涵清渚沙白，青天去山不盈尺。\n谁倾河汉洗霄氛，千顷波流浸坤脉。\n松下山人绿发翁，眼前霜根化为石。\n壶天旷荡足栖迟，枕穴须臾岂荣适。\n不知楚汉已随尘，自分烟霞久成癖。\n一朝沆瀣充枯肠，万古乾坤信双屐。\n草木知春自觉秋，日出为朝入还夕。\n应怜世上夸毗子，按辔迟回碍行役。\n不辞白首怀千金，欲买青山爱双璧。\n我忆洞江烟水村，高山为屏草铺席。\n岂无竹屋三两间，亦有烟波舟一只。\n会须养疴归去来，怅望秋空暮云碧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27591,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题钟文选云山图歌","author":"许天锡","text":"石屏山人过我游，手携群峰挈沧洲。\n买我如舟小斋里，景象落落乾坤浮。\n江声撼瑶席，山色悬清秋。\n碧树何渺渺，白云空悠悠。\n霏微烟岚湿不收，翠光欲上人衣裘。\n洞江先生起梳头，对之不觉宿疴瘳。\n但见翠微人家疏复稠，石田茅屋莓苔幽。\n小横桥涧风飕飕，无人濯足寒矶头。\n矶头一叶小艋艇，我欲乘之随长流。\n宁须骑鹤驾苍虬，与君鼓枻访丹丘，餐霞饮瀣穷冥搜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27592,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余使交州得木山于僧寮峰峦䆗窱坚如岩石用梅都官赋木假山韵","author":"许天锡","text":"万年木精化青牛，瘦骨不朽沈江洲。\n江州水激鱼龙秋，神物始出随回流。\n玲珑嵂崒谁能锼，山僧得之溪洞酋。\n蛮方僻远绝赏鉴，木尔韬晦谁怨尤。\n洞江先生好事者，邂逅愿脱千金裘。\n古来琴材出爨下，拔尔幸免为人槱。\n风厓雨谷偕我老，无复梦想仍丹邱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27593,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨白花","author":"许天锡","text":"春宫深，春昼长，杨花飞舞春云香。\n随风忽度江南去，万紫千红俱断肠。\n离魂渺渺如春水，荡渌杨花几千里。\n杨花流落向天涯，宫树朝鸦复暮鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27594,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日掖垣书感","author":"许天锡","text":"迟日掖垣阴，殷忧愧此心。\n禦戎无上策，抚事独长吟。\n花柳青春好，烟霄紫阁深。\n悠悠空岁月，衰白易相寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27595,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"往岁","author":"许天锡","text":"皇华思往岁，一骑入云中。\n笛里愁人月，霜前落叶风。\n寒川陶战骨，野火燎秋空。\n闻道河西寇，今来欲向东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27596,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"居庸关","author":"许天锡","text":"天设居庸险，乾坤此北门。\n山川通上郡，形势冠中原。\n铁骑连三戍，金城迫九阍。\n万方资阨塞，永荷太平恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27597,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月","author":"许天锡","text":"关山秋夜月，南客独来看。\n野迥金波阔，风严玉兔寒。\n不堪闻戍鼓，且未息征鞍。\n孤寡空村里，何时涕泗乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27598,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡来","author":"许天锡","text":"胡来青黍尽，胡去幕南开。\n日落单于口，秋生李牧台。\n阴风吹杀气，战骨蚀苍苔。\n洒泪向千古，斯人安在哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27599,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九日","author":"许天锡","text":"客舍黄花节，今年花较迟。\n清霜存晚意，积雨滞芳时。\n兴欲谋长醉，狂来得好诗。\n缅怀情不尽，寥落忽成悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27600,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下诏狱","author":"许天锡","text":"落照犴门西，槐风拂面凄。\n夕葵行蚁散，秋草露螀啼。\n捧日心还北，看云首复低。\n居然动幽思，何必故园栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27601,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过德州","author":"许天锡","text":"迟日虹川远，春风锦䌫长。\n村明花几树，河折柳重行。\n汉使昭星象，周官列职方。\n閒情触佳景，聊为写诗章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27602,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中小饮","author":"许天锡","text":"落日在鱼梁，逢人问水乡。\n飞花随棹远，高柳过樽凉。\n故国春无及，晴川兴且长。\n频年诗酒约，百倍未能偿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27603,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过分水关","author":"许天锡","text":"石磴上不尽，青霄如可梯。\n到关闽海近，回首楚天低。\n绝巘愁飞鸟，晴潭落断霓。\n寻诗聊午憩，忽见日轮西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27604,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"憩枫亭驿","author":"许天锡","text":"枫阅他年世，亭馀旧日名。\n驱驰耽午寂，林薄送秋声。\n书卷行空载，尘心梦未清。\n侵晨犹远役，华发奈愁生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27605,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大烟驿閒步即景","author":"许天锡","text":"步屧缘沙岸，墙鸡忽乱号。\n村贫茅屋矮，驿古木绵高。\n白石堪垂钓，青溪欲染袍。\n渔人生理易，双桨小铜槽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":27606,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]